Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:01:11 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Corvid v1.4: CPU frequency governor of the host

GET/PUT /api/v3/fork/cpu read and set the governor of all CPUs through the
host's /sys/devices/system/cpu mounted at /host/sys/cpu. The choice is
stored and applied again at start; "" gives the host's original back.

